title: "Digital Romania Atlas"
abstract: >-
  Interactive atlas of the Romanian digital identity ecosystem (RO EUDI Wallet)
  versus a proposed digital backbone design: institutions, data flows, comparison,
  timeline, strategy, resilience and a live bridge to the administrative-reform
  simulator.
